      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 50 Shingán is a most attractive and well-presented three bedroomed semi-detached property in one of Enniscorthy’s most popular and contemporary residential developments, just off the Milehouse Road. Presented to the market in ready to move into condition, just freshly painted and with fresh new flooring throughout with a mix of high-spec vinyl, tiling and brand new carpets, this property is brimming with fantastic features such as private driveway, uPVC double glazing, oil fired central heating, fully fitted kitchen with appliances, open fireplace, spacious, well-appointed accommodation, master bedroom with ensuite, side gate for rear access and low maintenance rear garden. This splendid home is ready for immediate occupation and provides an ideal blank page for any discerning purchaser to write their next chapter! In addition to being a fabulous starter home this property would also be a fantastic investment opportunity.  \r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nThese very well laid out accommodations are most tastefully presented to include entrance hall laid to high-spec vinyl flooring, freshly carpeted staircase to first floor, and downstairs tiled WC, leading to spacious sitting room with attractive timber surround open fireplace and vinyl flooring, with double doors leading to kitchen. The kitchen/dining room features fully fitted maple shaker style kitchen, appliances included, part tiled walls, mix of vinyl and tiled areas, and rear garden access via sliding patio door.  \r\nThe first floor includes three lovely sized bedrooms, all of which have been freshly laid to carpet, as well as newly carpeted landing with hotpress. The spacious master bedroom offers the benefit of ensuite with tiled floor & part tiled walls and Triton electric shower. The main bathroom consists of fully tiled floors, part tiled walls, wc/whb and bathtub with mains shower.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nA private concrete driveway guides you to the front door, flanked by green areas on both sides, the property also offers ample front parking. Access to the rear is granted by way of private side gate and leads to low maintenance back garden fully laid to lawn, fenced/walled in on either side and abounded by mature trees and shrubbery for privacy.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains electricity, mains drainage, mains water, oil fired central heating. \r\n\r\nBER \r\nC2\r\n\r\nSize\r\nc. 90 sq. m. approx. \r\n \r\nIncluded\r\nOven/hob, fridge freezer, washing machine, tumble dryer, \r\n\r\nShingán\r\nShingán is a well sought after and well-maintained residential development, located in Enniscorthy’s Milehouse area. Only a short stroll to many local amenities such as service station, shops, Lidl, Aldi, supermarkets, pharmacy, butchers etc. Little Treasure crèche is also in walking distance, as is St. Aidan’s Primary school, and Enniscorthy Vocational College. \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nY21 Y6Y6\r\nFrom Enniscorthy at top of town, proceed past Pettitt’s Supervalu in direction of Kiltealy, pass through roundabout at Lidl & Aldi, proceed 0.5 miles and Shingán is on the left-hand side."
      },
